OL,3,CPolls open in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral by-election
OL,6,FPolling stations have opened in
OL,7,FGreater Manchester as residents elect
OL,8,Fa new Mayor, following the Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham's move to
OL,10,FWestminster.
OL,12,FMore than three million people from 10
OL,13,Fboroughs are preparing to vote in what
OL,14,Fwill be the biggest by-election in
OL,15,FBritish history - with the successful
OL,16,Fcandidate expected to be announced a
OL,17,Fday later.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
