OL,3,CPolls open in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral by-election
OL,6,FSeven candidates are on the ballot,
OL,7,Fusing the Supplementary Voting system
OL,8,Fwhich means voters can select a first
OL,9,Fand second choice.
OL,11,FPeople are reminded to take a valid
OL,12,Fphoto ID with them, and have until
OL,13,F10pm to cast their vote.
OL,15,FWho is standing in the Greater
OL,16,FManchester mayoral by-election?
OL,18,FCandidates are in displayed in
OL,19,Falphabetical order.
